#: ../../../hwmon/tvs-mpfs.rst:16
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/tvs-mpfs.rst:18
msgid ""
"This driver implements support for the temperature and voltage sensors on "
"PolarFire SoC. The temperature reports how hot the die is, and the voltages "
"are the SoC's 1.05, 1.8 and 2.5 volt rails respectively."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/tvs-mpfs.rst:24
msgid "Usage Notes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/tvs-mpfs.rst:26
msgid "update_interval has a permitted range of 0 to 8 milliseconds."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/tvs-mpfs.rst:28
msgid ""
"Temperatures are read in millidegrees Celsius, but the hardware measures in "
"degrees Kelvin, storing the result as 11.4 fixed point data, for a maximum "
"value of 2047.9375 degrees Kelvin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/tvs-mpfs.rst:32
msgid ""
"Voltages are read in millivolts. The hardware measures in millivolts, "
"storing the value as 12.3 fixed point data, for a maximum of 4095.875 "
"millivolts. The minimum value reportable by the driver is 0 volts, although "
"the hardware is capable of measuring negative values."
msgstr ""

